Happy, thank you more, please, Shuntan.
开心，更谢谢你，顺坦。

00:48:05.539 --> 00:48:06.980
Thanks for that.
谢谢你。

00:48:06.980 --> 00:48:07.980
That's lovely.
太可爱了。

00:48:07.980 --> 00:48:08.980
That's wonderful.
太棒了。

00:48:08.980 --> 00:48:15.460
You know, I really love this observation, a serious drama disguised as a comedy.
你知道，我真的很喜欢这个观察，一部伪装成喜剧的严肃戏剧。

00:48:15.460 --> 00:48:16.460
That's the show.
这就是节目。

00:48:16.460 --> 00:48:18.980
I thought that was a really wonderful observation.
我认为这是一个非常精彩的观察。

00:48:18.980 --> 00:48:19.980
Yeah.
是的。

00:48:19.980 --> 00:48:20.980
Me too.
我也是。

00:48:20.980 --> 00:48:21.980
I love that way of framing it.
我喜欢这种框架方式。

00:48:21.980 --> 00:48:22.980
That's how we think of it.
我们就是这么想的。

00:48:22.980 --> 00:48:31.219
And that's the Trojan horse we were sneaking on to CBS in 2005 among a lot of other sitcoms or sitcoms.
这就是 2005 年我们在 CBS 的许多其他情景喜剧或情景喜剧中偷偷植入的特洛伊木马。

00:48:31.219 --> 00:48:32.219
I would say.
我会说。

00:48:32.219 --> 00:48:33.219
I don't even mean that as an insult.
我什至没有侮辱的意思。

00:48:33.219 --> 00:48:38.219
different tones, and we were kind of, we were our own little thing, and that's what we were, so thanks for seeing it.
不同的语气，我们是我们自己的小东西，这就是我们，所以感谢您看到它。

00:48:38.219 --> 00:48:40.610
Yeah, thanks so much.
是的，非常感谢。

00:48:40.610 --> 00:48:49.300
I am guilty, please equip me, all sins are forgiven, in New York City.
我有罪，请装备我，所有的罪孽都被宽恕，在纽约。

